---
import '../styles/theme.css';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <!-- Google tag (gtag.js) -->
          <script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-33317PM2RQ"></script>
          <script>
            window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
            function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}
            gtag('js', new Date());
          
            gtag('config', 'G-33317PM2RQ');
          </script>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>NSE Live Price Action | Smart Money Terminal</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 viewBox=%220 0 100 100%22><text y=%22.9em%22 font-size=%2290%22>📈</text></svg>" />

    <!-- Sectoral Flow table styling.
         is:global is required because the table HTML is injected by app.js at runtime
         (Astro's default scoped styles would not match it). Colours match the site's
         gold / green / red palette; row & header styling is inherited from .data-table. -->
    <style is:global>
      .sector-note {
        margin: 0 0 10px 2px;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        opacity: 0.7;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      }
      .sector-table th.num,
      .sector-table td.num {
        text-align: right;
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }
      .sector-table td.sector-name {
        font-weight: 600;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }
      .sector-table td.time-cell {
        text-align: center;
        opacity: 0.75;
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }
      .sector-table th.time-head {
        text-align: center;
      }
      .sector-table td.pos {
        color: #2ecc71;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .sector-table td.neg {
        color: #e74c3c;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .sector-table td.flat {
        opacity: 0.7;
      }
      .sector-table td.hot {
        background: rgba(201, 162, 39, 0.10);
      }
      .sector-table .arrow {
        font-size: 0.7em;
        margin-right: 4px;
        opacity: 0.9;
      }
      .sector-table .rank {
        display: inline-block;
        min-width: 1.4em;
        margin-right: 8px;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        opacity: 0.55;
        text-align: right;
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="hero-card">
        <div class="hero-eyebrow">NSE &nbsp;•&nbsp; Institutional Grade Screener</div>
        <div class="hero-title">Live Price Action Terminal</div>
        <div class="hero-subtitle">Track where the Smart Money of Big Fund Houses is moving — in real time</div>
      </div>

      <div class="controls-card">
        <div class="checkbox-row">
          <input type="checkbox" id="fo-checkbox" checked />
          <label for="fo-checkbox">Only F&amp;O Stocks</label>
        </div>
        <div class="status-pill-wrap" id="status-pill-wrap">
          <span class="status-pill">
            <span class="status-dot"></span>
            <span class="status-label">Loading…</span>
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="tab-list">
        <button class="tab-btn active" data-tab="5m">⏱️ 5 Minutes</button>
        <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="15m">⏳ 15 Minutes</button>
        <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="D">📅 Today</button>
        <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="open">🔔 Pre-Open Market</button>
      </div>

      <div class="tab-panel active" id="panel-5m"></div>
      <div class="tab-panel" id="panel-15m"></div>
      <div class="tab-panel" id="panel-D"></div>
      <div class="tab-panel" id="panel-open"></div>

      <div class="footer-quote" id="quote-block">"All a person needs to do is observe what the market is telling him &amp; evaluate it" — Jesse Livermore</div>
      <div class="lucky-number-wrap">
        <button id="lucky-btn" class="lucky-btn">🎲 My Lucky No. Today -> </button>
        <span id="lucky-number" class="lucky-number">0</span>
      </div>
      <div class="about-section">
        <button id="about-toggle" class="about-toggle-btn">Developed by Saurabh Sharma ▾</button>
        <div id="about-content" class="about-content">
          <p>Saurabh has spent & survived 18 years in the stock market- trading equities & derivatives (Index, Stocks & Commodity -particularly Gold). He specializes in contra-momentum trading, with a consistently strong win rate in his personal trading account. </p>
          <p>He also has 14 years of experience working in corporate data and analytics roles within the financial and investment domain. He is an alumnus of IMT Ghaziabad (MBA) and YMCA Faridabad (B.Tech) </p>
          <p>He has built multiple tools to support his own trading strategies. This one, he has made available for public use — to help traders stay ahead in the market by tracking where the big money is moving, in real time. Having this information as it happens gives users an edge that most other market participants simply don't have.</p>
          <p>Saurabh believes trading is a skill, not luck. Like any skill, it is learned by following a process with discipline and commitment, practiced consistently over time.</p>
          <p>For any questions or a quick discussion or learning, feel free to mail him — or book a session.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="footer-contact"><a href="mailto:pa_trades@outlook.com">✉️ Want to Learn Trading? OR Have a query? Contact: pa_trades@outlook.com</a></p>
      <p class="footer-note">**Only Stocks with Traded value above 10L</p>
    </div>

    <script type="module" src="/scripts/app.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
